<title>DUBAI: TENNIS-MUSTER CAPTURES DUBAI OPEN.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-MUSTER CAPTURES DUBAI OPEN.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-02-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Final result in the $1 million Dubai Open men's tennis tournament on Sunday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>2-Thomas Muster (Austria) beat 1-Goran Ivanisevic (Croatia) 7-5 7-6 (7-3)</p>
</text>
